    "fix: [taal] in 'of en hoe hy wil hê jy moet jammer sê, soos met 'n briefie': 'of en hoe' stacks two conjunctions and makes a reader stumble.",
    "fix: [taal] in 'Childline is ekstra hulp en nie in plaas van hierdie grootmense nie': The verbless 'en nie in plaas van hierdie grootmense nie' reads stiffly.",
    "fix: [taal] in 'Childline is ekstra hulp en nie in plaas van die grootmense naby jou n': The verbless 'en nie in plaas van die grootmense naby jou nie' reads stiffly.",
    "fix: [taal] in 'dat jy dit amper sonder om te dink doen': The definition ends on a second 'doen' after the inserted phrase, which reads clumsily.",
    "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'Hou op om saam te doen.': Vague: it does not say with whom or in what; the reader must reach back to 'saamlag wanneer die groep dit doen' two blocks earlier. Making it explicit (e.g. joining in when a group bullies) would mean guessing the intended scope, so it is flagged rather than changed."
  ],
